; tiles.xon -- the delve set drawn, for a windowed front-end: a lamp-lit
; coal pit, wet rock, timber and iron.
;
; Read by the graphical front-end only: the set itself is the .xon files
; one directory up, and this directory is not one of them.
;
; (size W H) is every tile's size in pixels.  (colour "C" R G B [A]) names
; a colour by one character; A is 255 unless given, and 0 is clear.
; (tile NAME . PROPS) draws NAME: a glyph name (wall, player, potion, ...)
; or a creature's name.  (rows "..." ...) is the picture, one string a
; row, one character a pixel; (as OTHER) draws NAME as OTHER; (band
; "BAND") makes it that band's, in front of the set's.  Anything with no
; tile is drawn as its glyph in the font.

(size 16 16)

(colour "." 0 0 0 0)
(colour "k" 20 16 15)
; rock: sandstone beds, shale, a coal seam
(colour "d" 46 38 34)
(colour "r" 78 64 54)
(colour "R" 108 90 74)
(colour "h" 146 124 100)
(colour "n" 30 28 32)
(colour "N" 70 68 78)
; the floor, and the floor where light falls from above
(colour "s" 52 46 42)
(colour "f" 66 58 52)
(colour "F" 86 76 66)
(colour "z" 118 104 78)
